    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14789" root="رج" body-key="r">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرَجَّتْ</span></b>  <i>She</i> (a mare) <i>was near to bringing
forth, and the part on either side of her tail</i>
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَلَاهَا</span>) <i>quivered,</i> or <i>quaked;</i> (K;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِرْتَجَّتْ</span></b> . (TA.) The part. n. applied to the
mare in this case is ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرِجٌّ</span></b>  [without <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>]. (K.)

